<title>USA: Yields mixed on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</title>
<headline>Yields mixed on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on all three of the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices are mixed this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday was 5.53 percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.45 percent, up one basis points.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 5.78 percent, down four.</p>
<p>					Latest Previous Last Date</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.53%    5.53%   7/2/97</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.45%    5.44%   7/2/97</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 5.78%    5.82%   7/2/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
